## ts-morph Performance Warning

**ts-morph can be slow on large codebases.** Follow these guidelines:

### Performance Traps to AVOID:
```typescript
// BAD: getExportedDeclarations() can take 1+ second
const exports = sourceFile.getExportedDeclarations();

// BAD: Holding all nodes in memory
const allFunctions = project.getSourceFiles().flatMap(f => f.getFunctions());

// BAD: Re-creating program between manipulations
file1.addFunction(...);  // Program reset
file2.addFunction(...);  // Program reset again
```

### Performance Best Practices:
```typescript
// GOOD: Forget nodes when done
for (const file of project.getSourceFiles()) {
  processFile(file);
  file.forget();  // Release memory
}

// GOOD: Use getImportDeclarations() instead of full exports
const imports = sourceFile.getImportDeclarations();

// GOOD: Lazy load project
private project: Project | null = null;

// GOOD: Incremental updates - don't rebuild entire graph
invalidate(file: string): void {
  this.imports.delete(file);
  const sourceFile = this.project?.getSourceFile(file);
  if (sourceFile) this.processFile(sourceFile);
}
